  Slug: pyre-tender
  DisplayName: Pyre Tender
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You're experienced at building funeral pyres. You might have lit flaming
    biers in the Land of the Linnorm Kings, tended the cremation pits of Cheliax
    or Vudra, or been a backwoods charcoal burner, using the right mixture of alchemy
    to act as an accelerant. However you worship, you know nothing sends off the
    departed like flame. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or
    Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Crafting
    skill and the Funeral Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Alchemical
    Crafting] skill feat.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Book of the Dead
